{
  "id": "terrarium",
  "name": "Terrarium",
  "description": "An incredibly complex living ecosystem in a glass jar. Plants grow, seed, and decay; fungi recycle the litter; while snails, a centipede, and an ant colony interact in a closed simulation of water, nutrients, and light across shifting day and night cycles. Nothing goes permanently extinct.",
  "author": "Luci Evol - www.evoldigitalproductions.com",
